{"sourceUrl":"https://art.csu.edu.cn/info/1060/4827.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.318311+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://art.csu.edu.cn/info/1060/4827.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><span>为做好</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐优秀应届本科毕业免试攻读研究生考核录取工作</span></span><span><span>，经学院</span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span>招生工作领导小组</span></span><span><span>研究决定，</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>我院</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span>考核录取工作通知</span></span><span><span>如下</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、工作原则</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>坚持</span></span><span><span>综合评价、择优录取，严格执行</span></span><span><span>相关</span></span><span><span>政策，严守工作纪律，规范录取行为，</span></span><span><span>强化监督管理</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>切实做好</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推免招生</span></span><span><span>各项工作，确保公平、公正、科学。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    二、组织</span></span><span><span>管理</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一）</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>研究生招生工作领导小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span></span><span><span>长：</span></span><span><span>石磊、柯朝晖</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>徐鸣</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>成</span></span><span><span>员</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>刘雪梅、解明镜、陈乐凯、李志榕、郑伯红、朱力、</span></span><span><span>张俊、伍彦谚、蒋烨、罗红胜、丁蕾、洪洋（心理专干）</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   秘</span><span>书：李琳丰</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学院研究生招生思想政治表现考核小组</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span><span>长：</span></span><span><span>柯朝晖</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>成</span><span>员：刘雪梅、</span></span><span><span>罗明、许砚梅、罗红胜、吴俊霆、邹涛、徐皎</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学科专业</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立学科专业</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>小组，具体实施</span></span><span><span>申请材料审核及</span></span><span><span>学科</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、招生</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院研究生</span></span><span><span>招生专业</span></span><span><span>包括</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    （一）学术学位</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>0813</span><span>建筑学</span></span><span><span>、</span><span>1403</span><span>设计学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    （二）专业学位：</span><span>0851</span><span>建筑、</span><span>0853</span><span>城乡规划、</span><span>1352</span><span>音乐、</span><span>1357</span><span>设计</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校推免生预报名信息采集系统中的招生专业仅供参考，具体推免生招生专业以公布的</span><span>2026年研究生推免招生专业目录为准，最终录取专业以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”中录取确认为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人仅限申请以上一个专业。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、</span></span><span><span>申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，在校期间未受过任何纪律处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>届优秀本科毕业生，且有望取得所在学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）具有良好的心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、考核安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>申请报名时间和网址：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日—</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日，通过“中南大学推免生服务系统”进行网上报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>根据报名实际情况，</span></span><span><span>由申请材料审核专家组</span></span><span><span>遴选</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>名单，</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得考核资格，可参加现场考核；如显示“待审核”，则是审核不合格，学院不再另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>获得考核资格学生在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日前加入</span></span><span><span>建筑与艺术</span></span><span><span>学院考核</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群（群号另行通知，请保持手机畅通并关注我院官网），过期视为放弃考核资格。后期考核相关通知信息将在群内发布。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>现场考核时间安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考核时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>--17</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考核地点：中南大学建筑与艺术学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>具体安排：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日 </span><span>14:30</span><span>—</span><span>17:00 </span><span>报到、心理健康测试、申请材料原件核验、抽签</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日 </span><span>8:30</span><span>—</span><span>10:30  </span><span>讲座</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日 </span><span>13:30</span></span><span><span>—</span><span>18:00 </span><span>复试考核（具体安排另行通知）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   六、资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   完成网上申请的学生于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日前提交资格审查材料至电子邮箱</span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:2920725488@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2920725488@qq.com</a></span></span><span><span>，邮件主题为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span><span>申请专业名</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科学校名称</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料按顺序整理成一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span><span>申请专业名</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科学校名称</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>。<span><span>提交资格审查的材料如下：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （一）网上报名《申请表》</span></span><span><span>一份</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （二）本人身份证和学生证</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>个人简历（限</span><span>1</span><span>页）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>）学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   （</span></span><span><span>八</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>作品集（建筑类、城乡规划类、设计类考生）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    以上材料原件在面试考核当天由工作人员现场核验后返还。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>若推免过程中存在弄虚作假情况，一经查实</span></span><span><span>，将取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    七、考核内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    考核</span></span><span><span>内容</span></span><span><span>如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>  （一）</span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> 心理健康测试考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，考核不合格不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> （二）思想政治表现考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治表现考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，考核不合格不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> （三）面试</span></span><span><span>内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span> （</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>专业基础测试</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>  专业基础测试采用综合性、开放性的能力型试题，考生随机抽取</span></span><span><span>试题</span></span><span><span>；时间充足条件下可对考生随机提问，满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> （</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   综合素质及能力测试考试方式由考官随机提问。满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> （</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>外语能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>  外语测试一般采取听说交流的形式。满分为</span>100<span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿，我院将根据学院推免录取实际情况发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>九、</span></span><span><span>其他</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span></span><span><span>开通后，学院根据报名情况决定是否开展第二轮面试考核，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本通知内容与教育主管部门</span></span><span><span>及学校</span></span><span><span>日后下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门</span></span><span><span>及学校</span></span><span><span>下达的文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院办公</span></span><span><span>电话：</span>0731-</span><span>8883</span><span><span>0104  </span><span>李老师</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学</span></span><span><span>建筑与艺术</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"f9704f5ec1c439f5f55dfe915d7fb2079292119a9a188cb6987e799ac9ddc164","textLength":2118,"sourceSha256":"ff3b7cdba8c3a4a2ea8a1209912e6e988b3102f38dea2976680a21e712fee698","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-92192e156629fdfe21ab","title":"2025年中南大学建筑与艺术学院2026年推荐优秀应届本科毕业免试攻读研究生考核录取工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.318311+00:00"}
